e. Finché non perde la testa per Lucy, che impiegando ogni mezzo riesce a conquistare. C'è un problemino, però: Lucy non ha memoria breve, cioè durante la notte dimentica quanto accaduto il giorno. Per Henry ha inizio una sfida estenuante, riconquistare Lucy tutti i giorni, ripartendo da zero!","tagline":"Se la tua ragazza perdesse la memoria dovresti riconquistarla ogni giorno"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Henry is a player skilled at seducing women. But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total recall, he realizes it's possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again. That's because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.","tagline":"Imagine having to win over the girl of your dreams... every friggin' day."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5WvOLAkUNjC2PmxBSurarpsbFt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8lPo8UWKyP2tIXD8N64HfNP4Pw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1824,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5WvOLAkUNjC2PmxBSurarpsbFt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n5WvOLAkUNjC2PmxBSurarpsbFt.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5WvOLAkUNjC2PmxBSurarpsbFt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n5WvOLAkUNjC2PmxBSurarpsbFt.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYWCdHLJfn1s3nCvbvzue7HF4gn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYWCdHLJfn1s3nCvbvzue7HF4gn.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hiE